m_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/3d471a5eb93e060b024631ead79fd3b7.poster.avif?t=1753376422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/3d471a5eb93e060b024631ead79fd3b7.webm?t=1753376422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your hotel sits on a magical, floating island drifting through space, filled with life and mystery. Cultivate lush gardens, <strong>nurture bonds with fantastical creatures, and harvest alien ingredients</strong> to create mouthwatering dishes. Every connection you form with the island - be it tending to alien plants or befriending creatures like the Moonkels and Yetlets - shapes the hotel\u2019s success and fosters harmony in this living world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/de0176c9dd714d45ae42f0bcbb9b033b.poster.avif?t=1753376422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/de0176c9dd714d45ae42f0bcbb9b033b.webm?t=1753376422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Innovate and expand with your smartest staff by crafting and researching new tools, equipment, and technologies. Adapt your hotel to cater to a variety of unique races, each bringing new challenges and unlocking <strong>different research paths</strong> that shape your approach to hospitality. Discover hidden resources and delve into the <strong>island\u2019s underground complex</strong> to unlock new materials, creatures, and construction spaces. Every choice brings new opportunities, allowing your hotel to grow and thrive in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a magical journey to restore Hotel Galactic, making it a beloved destination for travelers far and wide. Balance heartfelt storytelling with creative gameplay, experiment with fresh ideas, and watch as your hotel flourishes under your care. <strong>Whether you\u2019re crafting a serene escape or exploring a world of culinary wonders, Hotel Galactic is a cozy, narrative-driven experience unlike any other.</strong></p>",
